Recommends: 7zip-rar
Description: VeltOS Archive, an archive manager in WinRAR's layout
 Opens ZIP, RAR, 7Z, TAR, GZ, BZ2, XZ, ZST, ISO, CAB and other archives in
 WinRAR's layout with Windows 11 controls: the toolbar of large pictures
 (Add, Extract To, Test, View, Delete, Find, Info), folders inside the
 archive, password-protected archives, and WinRAR's progress window for
 File Explorer's "Extract all" and "Compress".
 .
 Archives are read and written with 7-Zip; RAR needs the 7zip-rar plugin
 (non-free) for all RAR versions. ZIP, 7Z and TAR.GZ/TAR.XZ/TAR.ZST
 archives can be created; creating RAR archives needs RARLAB's own
 program.
